    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Warning!!!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>This is not the kind of Anime Horror Puzzle RPG you played before!!!</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains a lot of adult elements, including but not limited to: blood, violence, brutal graphics, severed limbs, sudden frightening screens, suppressed noises, psychological cues, flashes and other extremely uncomfortable elements! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think carefully about whether this is the type of game you're looking for, and if you're looking for a creepy but fun gaming experience, you might be at the right place! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Have you heard that rumor?&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;There is a terrible legend in the house in the distance...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The old man who used to live there was considerate and kind and helped everyone do a lot of things...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;But I didn't expect it, and I don't know what happened, the whole family was not spared...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The grapevine says that the frightened &quot;Spiritualist Society&quot; did it...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The poor maid has been hit hard psychologically...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;So far...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone, we are Muharukahana Studios, and our indie game &quot;Margarita(Berkeley's Maid: Remake Edition)&quot; is a complete remake of the acclaimed horror game &quot;Berkeley's Maid&quot; that we launched in mobile platform, with a richer and more complete plot, more diverse gameplay, and more distinctive puzzle design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The remake version is based on the RPG Maker MZ, a survival horror + psychological horror-based pixel horror RPG in which you play as a maid named Nordisy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are so many things you need to do!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles and Exploring!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious home with hidden secrets, perhaps related to your deceased father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the deeper you fall, the more you fall, you can only solve the puzzle in a terrifying environment and find a way out...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/Gamaplay3.gif</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to a well-designed survival challenge and battle the unpredictable environment under extreme stress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/gameplay2.gif</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To live to see people, to die to see corpses, only <i>time</i> can answer everything </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/gameplay4.gif</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But maybe you don't want to know the truth as much as you think?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The poor maid has been hit hard psychologically...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;So far... They are still serving the corpses on the bed...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming Soon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Warning!!!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>This is not the kind of Anime Horror Puzzle RPG you played before!!!</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains a lot of adult elements, including but not limited to: blood, violence, brutal graphics, severed limbs, sudden frightening screens, suppressed noises, psychological cues, flashes and other extremely uncomfortable elements! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think carefully about whether this is the type of game you're looking for, and if you're looking for a creepy but fun gaming experience, you might be at the right place! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Have you heard that rumor?&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;There is a terrible legend in the house in the distance...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The old man who used to live there was considerate and kind and helped everyone do a lot of things...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;But I didn't expect it, and I don't know what happened, the whole family was not spared...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The grapevine says that the frightened &quot;Spiritualist Society&quot; did it...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The poor maid has been hit hard psychologically...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;So far...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone, we are Muharukahana Studios, and our indie game &quot;Margarita(Berkeley's Maid: Remake Edition)&quot; is a complete remake of the acclaimed horror game &quot;Berkeley's Maid&quot; that we launched in mobile platform, with a richer and more complete plot, more diverse gameplay, and more distinctive puzzle design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The remake version is based on the RPG Maker MZ, a survival horror + psychological horror-based pixel horror RPG in which you play as a maid named Nordisy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are so many things you need to do!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles and Exploring!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious home with hidden secrets, perhaps related to your deceased father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the deeper you fall, the more you fall, you can only solve the puzzle in a terrifying environment and find a way out...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/Gamaplay3.gif</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to a well-designed survival challenge and battle the unpredictable environment under extreme stress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/gameplay2.gif</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To live to see people, to die to see corpses, only <i>time</i> can answer everything </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/gameplay4.gif</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But maybe you don't want to know the truth as much as you think?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The poor maid has been hit hard psychologically...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;So far... They are still serving the corpses on the bed...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming Soon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
